---
layout: base.njk
permalink: archive/index.html
eleventyComputed:
  pageTitle: "AI Creative Daily — 所有報告"
  isArchiveIndex: true
---

<section class="archive-index">
  <h2>所有報告</h2>
  {% if switchableReports.length %}
  <p class="archive-index-count">共 {{ switchableReports.length }} 份</p>
  {%- for group in switchableReports | groupByMonth %}
  <div class="archive-month">
    <h3>{{ group.month }}</h3>
    <ul>
      {%- for d in group.days %}
      <li><a href="{{ ('/archive/' + d.date + '.html') | url }}">{{ d.day }}</a></li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
  {%- endfor %}
  {% else %}
  <p class="archive-index-count">還沒有可切換的報告。第一份報告產出後就會出現在這裡。</p>
  {% endif %}
</section>
